# Documentation: 09-public.http REST client collection.
# - Covers the unauthenticated public gym directory and tenant profile endpoints.
# - These requests are useful for smoke-testing the public catalog without setting up auth headers.
# - These requests are written for the VS Code REST Client extension and use its response-variable syntax extensively.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8787
@tenantSlug = seed-gym-1

### List public gyms
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/gyms?page=1&limit=20

### Get one public gym by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/gyms/{{tenantSlug}}
